'' A STRING ARGUMENT FOR A USTRING CONSTRUCTOR PARAMETER IN A 'dim shared' INITIALISER.
'' CtorArgsOnAddr_ built each string argument's temporary at the ARGUMENT's type, before the
'' constructor was picked, so 'dim shared as T a = T( "x" )' over 'constructor( byref p as
'' ustring )' passed a narrow descriptor the constructor read as UTF-16 -- std/logs'
'' FileSink created its file under a name of CJK characters -- and a wide argument passed
'' the wide literal itself, leaving the field empty. Both are now converted after the pick
'' (src/mir/lowerfieldinit.tiko). A module-level 'dim' took the declaration path and was
'' already right; it is here as the control.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/shared-ustring-ctor.bas -o tests/driver/sharedustrctor.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/sharedustrctor.exe
'' RUN: tests/driver/sharedustrctor.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: shared-init
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: wide
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: conv
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: byval
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: narrow|ustr| 7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: module-dim 11
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
